, "audio_s": 114.5}, {"t": 114.664, "kind": "outputTranscription", "text": "小林提出了「乘客由電車創造」的口號。他在箕面和寶塚建造了遊樂設施，並在池田打造了日本第一座郊區型出售住宅區——池田新市街，也就是後來的室町住宅。"}, {"t": 114.664, "kind": "generationComplete"}, {"t": 114.666, "kind": "turnComplete"}, {"t": 115.049, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 115.0}, {"t": 115.549, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 115.5}, {"t": 116.049, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 116.0}, {"t": 116.549, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 116.5}, {"t": 117.048, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 117.0}, {"t": 117.549, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 117.5}, {"t": 118.049, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 118.0}, {"t": 118.549, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 118.5}, {"t": 119.049, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 119.0}, {"t": 119.55, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 119.5}, {"t": 120.048, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 120.0}, {"t": 120.548, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 120.5}, {"t": 121.049, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 121.0}, {"t": 121.549, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 121.5}, {"t": 122.048, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 122.0}, {"t": 122.549, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 122.5}, {"t": 122.832, "kind": "inputTranscription", "text": "周辺 に は 病院 、 学校 と 日常 生活 に 必要 な 場 も 作ら れ 発展 し て いく 。"}, {"t": 122.832, "kind": "outputTranscription", "text": "周邊也建"}, {"t": 122.832, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 4}, {"t": 122.833, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 4}, {"t": 122.833, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 4}, {"t": 122.833, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 4}, {"t": 122.833, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 4}, {"t": 122.833, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 4}, {"t": 122.833, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 3200}, {"t": 122.833, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 10240}, {"t": 122.833, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 10240}, {"t": 122.833, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 10240}, {"t": 122.898, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 15360}, {"t": 122.906, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 2560}, {"t": 122.958, "kind": "outputTranscription", "text": "造了"}, {"t": 122.958, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 10240}, {"t": 122.997, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 10240}, {"t": 123.041, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 10240}, {"t": 123.048, "kind"